WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.660
Tell us a little bit about yourself, your
name, and how you came across the INNOXONE

00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:03.320
cart.

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:07.610
My name is Hal Peabody, and I came across
the INNOXONE when I was looking for a

00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:11.380
single rider golf cart.

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:14.870
And in the community I live in, we drive a
lot of golf carts, and I really liked

00:00:14.870 --> 00:00:17.940
riding alone.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:24.180
And I found it on YouTube, and fell in
love with it, and went to the website,

00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:31.220
and as the transition was going from V1 to
V2, version 1 to version 2,

00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:35.220
I came out to see Mr. Kim from Arizona to
Marbella Country Club in December, right

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:38.780
after Christmas,

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:44.220
and took a little test drive. And I love
the cart. It's just fabulous.

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:49.520
It's really nice to play by myself,
because I can go right to my ball,

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:52.840
I can think about what I want to think
about, and don't get distracted.

00:00:52.840 --> 00:00:55.500
And I've been playing some of the best
golf I've ever played since I got my cart

00:00:55.500 --> 00:00:58.160
about two months ago.

00:00:58.420 --> 00:01:01.640
It's just awesome. And it speeds up your
pace of play, doesn't it?

00:01:01.820 --> 00:01:04.780
It does. It absolutely does. And the more
we can get these out in the golf

00:01:04.780 --> 00:01:07.740
community,

00:01:08.140 --> 00:01:12.600
in communities like ours, is way better,
because the time would go much faster.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:15.740
And it's not that you play slow or
anything like that, but when you're

00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:18.480
playing at the right pace,

00:01:18.480 --> 00:01:24.520
it's such a better game, and I couldn't be
happier with the INNO-F1.

00:01:25.260 --> 00:01:27.220
And you could also ride it in your
neighborhood, couldn't you?

00:01:27.380 --> 00:01:32.680
I do. I take it from, in the community I'm
in, it takes me about three minutes

00:01:32.680 --> 00:01:36.740
to get from my house down to the gym, and
about three and a half minutes

00:01:36.740 --> 00:01:40.900
to get to the golf course, and it's just
great.

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:42.960
No need to bring your car, just bring your
golf cart.

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:46.280
That's it. Clubs are on the back all the
time.

00:01:46.280 --> 00:01:47.820
Well, thank you for stopping by.

00:01:48.160 --> 00:01:51.360
Thank you. It's a great experience. This
is a great place.

00:01:51.640 --> 00:01:52.220
Awesome. Thank you.
